The `parsePNGAndCache` method decodes the provided PNG file into a bitmap and caches it for future use. The options object of `BitmapFactory.Options` is used to set the preferred configuration of the bitmap. This ensures that the bitmap uses 32-bit color depth which can be beneficial in terms of memory usage and performance under certain conditions.
